==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''ljúka''' (+ {{dative}})

# to [[finish]], to [[end]]
# to [[complete]]
# to [[end]], to [[close]], to come or bring to an end
# [[finalise]]/[[finalize]]
# (of a limited period of time) to [[expire]]
# to [[conclude]]

